  "review": {
    "gallery": "Nine distinct native project images extracted from Danube’s original brochure. Stock and repeated water textures excluded. Both named interior schemes and the Maritime City elevation retained.",
    "location": "Original brochure page 4 identifies the development in Maritime City and prints eight approximate times. The developer aerial is schematic. JRE locates Breez near the end of the peninsula, separate from Shahrukhz Residences.",
    "floorPlans": "Four unchanged Danube PDFs from the official floor-plan archive. The standard and levels 22–25 books each supply 14 apartment drawings with different unit placements and some different totals. Seven villa drawing sheets, six retail drawings, four location plates and two amenity plans give 47 choices. Exact printed area panels visually checked. The duplicate amenity diagrams and broker editions were excluded."
  },
  "unavailable": [
    "The surveyed entrance and a unit-by-unit sales drawing schedule were not established. Danube website asset redistribution requires separate permission."
  ]
}
